{"product":{"id":9055168233695,"title":"Yara Candy","body_html":"\u003cdiv class=\"descnew\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\nIntroducing Yara Candy by Lattafa, a sugared up candy addition to the Yara family. Crafted with the finest ingredients from the heart of the Middle East, Yara Candy is a harmonious blend of luscious candied fruits and yummy vanilla syrup. The fragrance opens with a burst of juicy Green Mandarin and blackcurrant fruits, leading into a heart of blooming Gardenia \u0026amp; Strawberry Fizz Candy. This exquisite scent is perfect for those who appreciate the allure of a well-balanced and sophisticated fragrance.\n\n\n\n\n\n\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"notesfinal\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTop Notes\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eBlack Currant, Green Tangerine\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"notesfinal\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMiddle Notes\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eStrawberry Fizz Candy, Gardenia\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"notesfinal\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBase Notes\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eVanilla, Musk, Amber, Sandalwood\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e","vendor":"Lattafa","product_type":"Women","created_at":"2025-05-16T03:32:54-04:00","handle":"yara-candy","updated_at":"2026-10-09T16:48:51-04:00","published_at":"2025-05-16T03:32:54-04:00","template_suffix":null,"published_scope":"global","tags":"spo-cs-disabled, spo-default, spo-disabled, spo-notify-me-disabled, Trending","variants":[{"id":46981636161759,"product_id":9055168233695,"title":"100ml","price":"44.99","sku":"6290360599168","position":1,"compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"100ml","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2025-05-16T03:32:54-04:00","updated_at":"2026-10-09T16:48:51-04:00","taxable":true,"barcode":"6290360599168","grams":0,"image_id":null,"weight":0.0,"weight_unit":"lb","requires_shipping":tru